     2	# v3.9 Composite: ECM (macOS-native) + combined HID (kbd+abs pointer) + ADB (FFS), built IN g1
     3	# (stock adbd binds g1/UDC itself, so we reuse g1 rather than a separate gadget).
     4	# Requires the binary-patched STOCK kernel (ep3 ISO->INT + ep5out INT-capable, see
     5	# NOTES-stock-kernel-patch.md) + /data/mk20/usb_f_ecm.ko. HID/FFS are built in.
